From: Morgan Lee <morgan.lee@hangs-cs.example>
To: Tax preparation <tax@finance-demo.example>
Subject: HANGS Construction Services 2025 Form 1120 year-end records
Date: Mon, 02 Mar 2026 10:20:00 -0800
Message-ID: <HCS-2025-1120@hangs-cs.example>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary="=_HCS_2025_1120_records"

--=_HCS_2025_1120_records
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Hi,

Attached are our final adjusted trial balance at December 31, 2025, the gener=
al ledger detail for the accounts you asked about and the fixed asset registe=
r with book and tax depreciation. The prior-year return summary, the question=
naire, the estimated tax log and the members' consent are in the shared folde=
r. Please prepare the 2025 Form 1120 for us to review.

A few things you will want to look at:

- Our September estimated payment was only $5,000.00 because the Pier 9 Tech =
Center retainage came in late. We caught up on December 15.
- The $120,000.00 we advanced to Juniper Ridge Partners LLC in June has no no=
te yet. Let us know what you need.
- The members' consent for 2025 officer pay, including the President's $30,00=
0.00 bonus, still has to be signed. The bonus was paid January 9.
- The Labor and Industries penalty from July is in taxes and licenses.
- The depreciation software took 100% bonus on all four 2025 additions.

Thanks,
Morgan Lee
Controller, HANGS Construction Services LLC

--=_HCS_2025_1120_records
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64
Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="2025 year-end trial balance.xlsx"
MIME-Version: 1.0

